Time\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":0,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600}]},{\"uuid\":\"ba632d3e-9c2b-4413-a965-510c839b3f71\",\"name\":\"Random\",\"description\":\"This will take your palette colors and randomly animate them across your panels.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"party\",\" happy\"],\"features\":[\"touch\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"delayTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":0,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600}]},{\"uuid\":\"bc6fe7e0-36d4-4f95-aa21-52a386daa9dc\",\"name\":\"Ripple\",\"description\":\"Wisps of color dance across the display, creating a majestic ripple effect outwards based on the music's intensity. \",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"chill\",\" pop\",\" vibrant\",\" accoustic\"],\"features\":[]},{\"uuid\":\"fa0ce428-ad3a-40a9-84e4-1c9316644852\",\"name\":\"Classic Visualizer\",\"description\":\"An ode to the old school music visualizer. Your palette colors will be assigned left to right. Depending on your layout, colors may not all show up for larger palettes.\",\"author\":\"Nathan\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"party\",\" electronic\",\" vibrant\",\" pop\"],\"features\":[]},{\"uuid\":\"fe0d0ba8-741f-4210-940c-454eceed010f\",\"name\":\"Sound Bar\",\"description\":\"Two of your favorite colors compete in a dance-off to the intensity of music. The length of your setup will determine the direction the soundbar will go. Works best for softer music.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"ambient\",\" acoustic\",\" classical\",\" vocal\",\" chill\"],\"features\":[]},{\"uuid\":\"a2f3fcdc-dbe2-45cf-ac8b-2a9e5144ac24\",\"name\":\"Game Of Life\",\"description\":\"Tap some cells to bring them to life and watch Conway's Game Of Life evolve before your eyes! Lonely or overcrowded cells will fizzle out, alive cells with 2 or 3 neighbours will survive, and dead cells with 3 neighbours will come alive.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"nature\",\" zen\",\" chill\"],\"features\":[\"touch\",\"game\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"loop\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"defaultValue\":false},{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":8,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"delayTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":8,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600}]}]}"}]}
