beat of the music. The colors are taken from your palette, and randomly selected to correspond to the varying pitches in the song.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["vibrant"," happy"," classical"," pop"," acoustic"],"features":[],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600}]},{"uuid":"337784c0-6c98-447a-8a9f-fc6ac44a8024","name":"Streaking Notes","description":"Each color of your palette is assigned from low notes to high notes. When that note plays, you'll see that color shoot across your Aurora","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["pop"," party"," electronic"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"5cec763a-6f32-45cf-a691-b81e176b6b4a","name":"Fireworks","description":"This could be your very own mini EDM festival. In this musical fireworks display, explosions of color from your palette are set off to the bass of the song. ","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["happy"," electronic"," party"," vibrant"," pop"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"60333927-cc36-4a5a-a682-9bd114de8bff","name":"Pulse Pop Beats","description":"Designed for vocals and slow jams. Increased flux in the song will trigger pops of color on the panels, and a pulse of colors with fluctuation in the tone of the song. ","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["electronic"," rap"," classical"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"6970681a-20b5-4c5e-8813-bdaebc4ee4fa","name":"Wheel","description":"Provides a continuous moving gradient of color created from your palette.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["party"," chill"," zen"],"features":["touch"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"loop","type":"bool","defaultValue":true},{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600},{"name":"nColorsPerFrame","type":"int","defaultValue":2,"minValue":2,"maxValue":50},{"name":"linDirection","type":"string","defaultValue":"right","strings":["left","right","up","down"]}]},{"uuid":"70b7c636-6bf8-491f-89c1-f4103508d642","name":"Highlight","description":"Just like random, but you will mostly see the first color of your palette. The other colors fade in periodically.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["chill"," zen"],"features":["touch","dynamicPalette"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600},{"name":"delayTime","type":"int","defaultValue":15,"minValue":0,"maxValue":600},{"name":"mainColorProb","type":"double","defaultValue":80.0,"minValue":0.0,"maxValue":100.0}]},{"uuid":"713518c1-d560-47db-8991-de780af71d1e","name":"Burst","description":"Your palette colors radiate out from the center of the panels.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["chill"," zen"],"features":["touch"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"loop","type":"bool","defaultValue":true},{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600},{"name":"delayTime","type":"int","defaultValue":0,"minValue":0,"maxValue":600}]},{"uuid":"b3fd723a-aae8-4c99-bf2b-087159e0ef53","name":"Fade","description":"The Light Panels cycle through your palette colors all together.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["chill"," zen"],"features":["touch"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"loop","type":"bool","defaultValue":true},{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600},{"name":"delayTime","type":"int","defaultValue":0,"minValue":0,"maxValue":600}]},{"uuid":"ba632d3e-9c2b-4413-a965-510c839b3f71","name":"Random","description":"This will take your palette colors and randomly animate them across your panels.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["party"," happy"],"features":["touch"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600},{"name":"delayTime","type":"int","defaultValue":0,"minValue":0,"maxValue":600}]},{"uuid":"bc6fe7e0-36d4-4f95-aa21-52a386daa9dc","name":"Ripple","description":"Wisps of color dance across the display, creating a majestic ripple effect outwards based on the music's intensity. ","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["chill"," pop"," vibrant"," accoustic"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"fa0ce428-ad3a-40a9-84e4-1c9316644852","name":"Classic Visualizer","description":"An ode to the old school music visualizer. Your palette colors will be assigned left to right. Depending on your layout, colors may not all show up for larger palettes.","author":"Nathan","type":"rhythm","tags":["party"," electronic"," vibrant"," pop"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"fe0d0ba8-741f-4210-940c-454eceed010f","name":"Sound Bar","description":"Two of your favorite colors compete in a dance-off to the intensity of music. The length of your setup will determine the direction the soundbar will go. Works best for softer music.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["ambient"," acoustic"," classical"," vocal"," chill"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"b6aa071f-8377-4a04-819b-6fe8a7adb44c","name":"Snakes on a Plane","description":"If you're tired of these monkey fighting snakes on your Monday-Friday planes, try putting them up on your wall instead!","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["zen ","ambient"],"features":["touch"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600}]},{"uuid":"fa987895-9612-41c6-9ff4-b1d02cf5ce18","name":"LightCycle","description":"Take your Aurora out for a ride on the digital frontier where good and evil are locked in an eternal battle for cyberspace","author":"Seratonik","type":"rhythm","tags":["party","dim","warm","ambient","cool"],"features":[]}]}[0m
